            "review_text": "Nanooooo\nStrasbourg, France53 contributions\n0\nIcon of Tunis restaurants\nSep 2016 • Couples\nIt has been around for as long as I remember... I visited in the early 2000s and the food is still as good today as it was then. They have changed their name though to \"The Cliff\" which is the English translation. \n\nThe staff is not very friendly so patience is needed not to spoil the meal :-) \n\nWhether for lunch or dinner, it is a destination. \n\nThey also have a lower deck for a lighter type of meals (pizza...).\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 28, 2016",
